Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 the field
Text=The crossroads is not a crossroads any more. The English have put an army across it the way you would put a hand across a doorway, and the road west -- the only road west -- runs out from under the middle of them.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 the standard
Text=This is where the four roads met. Somebody has driven a standard into the stones at the centre of it, and the men around the standard are not watching Barcelona at all. They are facing west, waiting to be told to move.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 the road west
Text=The road west, and the ruts in it are fresh. An army came through here going the other way not long ago, and everything it did not want is still lying where it was dropped.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=4 what the column left
Text=The road west, and the ruts in it are fresh. In the churned mud at the verge there is a cracked lens, ground finer than any glazier in Barcelona could manage, and beside it a wax tablet pressed with a hand you have watched draw. Two men went down this road with a guard who had a list, and they left the only message they were able to leave.
Should Have Voiceover=0
